<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Zero-shot news summarization performance of LLMs with and without BLooP. Here, R-* is ROUGE-* and BS is BARTScore. <sup id="S5.T2.5" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S5.T2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">⋆</span></sup> denotes pseudo-summary pre-training and <sup id="S5.T2.6" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S5.T2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">†</span></sup> denotes fine-tuning on the target dataset. Underlined values indicate statistically significant improvements from BLooP as measured by FDR-corrected Wilcoxon signed-rank tests (<math id="S5.T2.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.05</annotation></semantics></math>).</figcaption>
</figure>
